KG42.register("clusters-9add5deabc1fc3715daad659",{"id":"35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v142-d-K003","paper":"35-microgrid_pool_strategy","label":"Network-constrained welfare clearing of electricity products and DLMP formation","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K003","label":"Network-constrained welfare clearing of electricity products and DLMP formation","market_meaning":"The distribution-system lower-level model takes submitted bids, costs and benefits, and network capacity conditions as inputs, performs day-ahead hourly power-pool clearing, selects participant power and microgrid exchange quantities, and generates nodal DLMP. The robust objective under price uncertainty is retained as a conditional variant, and gaps remain in the candidate's mathematical closure and specific applicable scope.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["DEM"],"process_stages":["clearing","pricing"],"scope_disposition":"unresolved","scope_explanation":"The welfare objective, capacity and network constraints, and DLMP source of the baseline LLPM are within the same scope. The robust objective is retained as a conditional variant, but its source-constraint references are inconsistent with the baseline scope, so it cannot yet be confirmed that it fully uses the same feasible region; the KKT non-negativity restriction also retains only its original representation condition.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"The welfare objective determines the selection criterion, capacity and network constraints determine the feasible allocation, DLMP is the price output of the same clearing, and the electricity product defines the traded object. These contents constitute a clearing candidate with independent market significance; the intra-MG exchange obligation and Case2 mode conditions are handled by another cluster.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This provides the day-ahead hourly clearing procedure and the frozen capacity, nodal-balance, and voltage constraints."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This provides the baseline welfare objective and the robust objective variant under price uncertainty, and the duplicated capacity constraints are retained through mapping."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R010","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This provides the price output by which clearing generates DLMP, as well as the conditional non-negativity constraint in the source KKT representation."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R011","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"This limits the traded object of the pool strategy to electricity as the product scope of the clearing rule and is not counted separately as another optimization rule."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-CN01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E12","v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g02-E14"],"rationale":"The source jointly defines the welfare objective, participant capacity, and DistFlow constraints as the baseline LLPM, so the objective and feasible region are assembled complementarily; this association does not automatically resolve the constraint scope of the robust variant."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-CN02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001","v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-X001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g02-E15"],"rationale":"The source states that the hourly DLMP is generated by the dual quantity of the LLPM active-power balance constraint; therefore network-constrained clearing and price generation are complementary outputs of the same clearing activity, and price non-negativity is not derived from the original balance equation alone."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-CN03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R011","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R011::phi::v141-c-R011-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-P-jt","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E12","v141-b-g02-E14"],"rationale":"The product description that the pool strategy trades electricity limits the scope of power exchange in the welfare objective; it only supplements product semantics and does not generate settlement or other product obligations on that basis."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::V::clearing.local","v141-c-R010::V::clearing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R004::V::clearing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E11"],"rationale":"Both places are the same frozen local clearing node, respectively describing the clearing constraints and their price output, and R004 is selected as the display entry."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM02","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09","v141-b-g02-E14"],"rationale":"Both constraints express the same baseline LLPM equations (9)-(10), with consistent lower and upper bounds, time periods, and participant sets; only a display representative is selected, and both original objects and bindings remain accessible."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM03","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-x-P_it","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-P-it"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09"],"rationale":"Both places are the generic active-power quantity for the same participant set and time period; the local uses in the capacity constraint and the welfare model are retained, and the participant categories are not equated with one another."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM04","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-x-Q_it","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-Q-it"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09"],"rationale":"Both places are the generic reactive-power quantity for the same participant set and time period in the baseline LLPM, retaining the local constraint roles of each chain."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM05","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::theta::v141-c-R004-theta-P_min_it","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-P-min-it"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09"],"rationale":"The two places correspond to the same baseline active-power lower bound and the same index range, retaining each original parameter and its local reference."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM06","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::theta::v141-c-R004-theta-P_max_it","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-P-max-it"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09"],"rationale":"The two places correspond to the same baseline active-power upper bound and the same index range; the association does not add any capacity value."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM07","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::theta::v141-c-R004-theta-Q_min_it","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-Q-min-it"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09"],"rationale":"The two places correspond to the same baseline reactive-power lower bound, retaining the original role and source binding of the frozen parameter."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-OM08","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R004::theta::v141-c-R004-theta-Q_max_it","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-Q-max-it"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E09"],"rationale":"The two places correspond to the same baseline reactive-power upper bound and the same participant scope; the association does not change any original parameter."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G01","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The network representation already frozen in R004 covers equations (13)-(16), but does not include the participant-power-to-node-injection mapping in equations (11)-(12) or the definitions of the related coefficients. The network-feasibility text in R005 cannot fill this mathematical interface.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-x-P_it","v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-x-Q_it","v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-x-P_inj_bt","v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-x-Q_inj_bt","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g02-E10","v141-b-g02-E14"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"C is to supplement the participant-to-node mapping, coefficient ranges, and necessary object relationships based on the manually checked sources; D only retains the current references and must not replace missing constraints with inter-chain associations."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G02","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The time operator retained in R005-C001 is consistent with g01-E15, whereas g02-E08 gives a cross-period summation, and the consumer quantity index differs between the two excerpts. The g02-E15 cited by R005-C001 is an explanatory passage, and g02-E16, which is additionally cited by the capacity object, mainly explains input parameters and the KKT transformation; neither can serve as a verbatim verification of the corresponding formula.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-P-lt","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-P-min-it"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E15","v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g02-E08","v141-b-g02-E09","v141-b-g02-E15","v141-b-g02-E16"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the time aggregation and consumer index in equation (8), and C is to correct the necessary source bindings; the capacity candidate mapping is provisionally based on g01-E16 and g02-E09 under the same mechanism, and the original C content remains unchanged."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G03","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The reference-voltage quantity in the voltage equation has not been explicitly defined, and the branch-reactance index also differs between the original network equation and the broader KKT excerpt; these notations cannot be automatically normalized by D.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::theta::v141-c-R004-theta-V_1","v141-c-R004::theta::v141-c-R004-theta-x_bt","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g01-E20","v141-b-g02-E12","v141-b-g02-E17"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Verify the reference-voltage definition, denominator, and branch-parameter index, and C is to supplement the definition or clarify the ambiguity in the original text; the current printed expression and parameter definitions continue to be retained as frozen."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G04","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The U_{nt} and U_{lt} referenced by the R005 robust objective do not yet have frozen set-definition constraints; although there is an uncertainty-level parameter, its domain is not closed. The inner worst-case optimization quantity is listed as a parameter in C, and its original classification requires further verification; the endpoint simplification has also not been frozen, and it cannot be adopted directly while ignoring the relevant product-sign conditions.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-d-nt","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-d-lt","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-xi-nt","v141-c-R005::theta::v141-c-R005-theta-xi-lt"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E35","v141-b-g02-E36","v141-b-g02-E37","v141-b-g02-E38","v141-b-g02-E45"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"C is to supplement the checked uncertainty set and local quantity roles; if the endpoint-equivalence expression is to be further adopted, the required signs and applicability conditions should first be verified, and D does not add sets or simplified expressions."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G05","category":"scope_conflict","description":"The constraint range printed in source g02-E39 for the robust model is equations (10)-(17), which is inconsistent with equations (9)-(16) of the baseline LLPM and involves the original KKT conditions. The frozen robust objective is insufficient to determine which complete set of constraints and corresponding price system should be inherited.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E12","v141-b-g02-E14","v141-b-g02-E39","v141-b-g02-E40"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the constraint numbering of the robust model and its KKT replacement scope, and then C is to clarify the conditional variant; before that, do not claim that the robust objective is fully consistent with the baseline feasible region and price conditions."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G06","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R010 freezes only the DLMP source and the non-negativity restriction in equation (32), not the complete KKT closure conditions. The active-power balance equation itself cannot imply that its dual price is non-negative; therefore this restriction should be retained as a specific representation condition of the original text, not as a general property of DEM prices.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003","v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-X001","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g01-E20","v141-b-g01-E21","v141-b-g01-E22","v141-b-g02-E20"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the dual domain of the source KKT and its consistency; if a mathematically closed pricing rule is required, C should supplement the relevant conditions, and the non-negativity restriction and its applicability premises are currently retained."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G07","category":"ontology_extension","description":"The generic local price node has not yet fully distinguished nodal location, the dual source of active-power balance, and the feedback use; the DLMP refinement proposal v141-b-g01-P01 remains unapproved.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R010::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-X001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E11"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-P01"],"required_work":"Manually decide whether the existing nodes plus textual qualification are sufficient, or whether to adopt the DLMP proposal; the current assembly does not insert new nodes."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G08","category":"unverified_source","description":"The formula excerpts, explanations, and duplicate-object correspondences used by this cluster are all based on currently unverified evidence, and there is not yet an independent source audit or scientific acceptance conclusion.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005","v141-c-R010","v141-c-R011"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E09","v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g01-E12","v141-b-g01-E15","v141-b-g01-E16","v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g01-E22","v141-b-g02-E14","v141-b-g02-E36","v141-b-g02-E37","v141-b-g02-E39"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the objective, constraints, indices, ranges, and source bindings item by item; in this round, no B audit, C2 independent review, or Agent E was performed."}]},"rule_refs":["35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R004","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R005","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R010","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R011"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","COMP-b6b40cce13bbdd1d","COMP-c6917f781ea3f39e","KG40-e94214b4dec2eb9b"]});
